    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs, milk, sugar, vanilla extract, and cinnamon in a bowl; dip toast into egg mixture and press into crushed corn flakes until coated. Arrange coated toast in a single layer in a baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
